(4156310, 598422, 70000, '<td valign="top">composition seems a bit dull and the lighting is flat, having a tree right in the middle of the photograph leaves the eye with nowhere to go, next time I would try putting it off to the side and having the shadow be a larger part of the image</td>', 'composition seems a bit dull and the lighting is flat, having a tree right in the middle of the photograph leaves the eye with nowhere to go, next time I would try putting it off to the side and having the shadow be a larger part of the image', '2007-10-10 03:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
