(4156395, 595926, 43073, '<td valign="top">Lovely take on the theme, with gentle light and soft shades and tones, a beautiful Irish vision, though I might have moved the moss in the frame a bit left (and tried to crop the "cross" just a bit higher up, as well).</td>', 'Lovely take on the theme, with gentle light and soft shades and tones, a beautiful Irish vision, though I might have moved the moss in the frame a bit left (and tried to crop the "cross" just a bit higher up, as well).', '2007-10-10 03:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
