(4157640, 597312, 66193, '<td valign="top">Deb, I like the textures in this one.  I also like how the DOF is arranged so that the front flower, and the portion of the wall are in focus, with OOF areas in between.  Adds a nice tension to the photo.  Also, the way the shadows reach out from the left add a wonderful balance to the flora on the right.</td>', 'Deb, I like the textures in this one.  I also like how the DOF is arranged so that the front flower, and the portion of the wall are in focus, with OOF areas in between.  Adds a nice tension to the photo.  Also, the way the shadows reach out from the left add a wonderful balance to the flora on the right.', '2007-10-10 12:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157642, 597067, 85108, '<td valign="top">too busy - flower in the right corner out of focus and detracts from rest of the scene</td>', 'too busy - flower in the right corner out of focus and detracts from rest of the scene', '2007-10-10 12:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
