(4157695, 597594, 85108, '<td valign="top">simple and elegant</td>', 'simple and elegant', '2007-10-10 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157718, 596072, 39830, '<td valign="top">wow... hope you can accept some constructive criticism. This shot has much potential, I think the multiple colors would really make and exceptional contrast. Here''s where you went wrong... Nothing is in focus: might try using manual next time if your camera has it; The posts: they got to go, end of story; Very pixelated: Could be that you oversharpened, but I suspect it is more likely too low of an ISO. Was it pretty dark when you shot the photo?<br/> <br/>I love the composition (other than the posts) and like I said I think it has great potential. You should try shooting this one again. 3</td>', 'wow... hope you can accept some constructive criticism. This shot has much potential, I think the multiple colors would really make and exceptional contrast. Here''s where you went wrong... Nothing is in focus: might try using manual next time if your camera has it; The posts: they got to go, end of story; Very pixelated: Could be that you oversharpened, but I suspect it is more likely too low of an ISO. Was it pretty dark when you shot the photo? I love the composition (other than the posts) and like I said I think it has great potential. You should try shooting this one again. 3', '2007-10-10 13:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
