(4157964, 598271, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t often comment anymore, but I will give my opinion on this.  I think having the leaf off-center would add interest, perhaps use a leaf with a more interesting shape.  Using shadow to cut down on the glare of light helps, but leaves this looking flat.  Also, I try to make sure that the shadow covers the entire image so as not to get the distracting light like in the upper right corner.</td>', 'I don''t often comment anymore, but I will give my opinion on this.  I think having the leaf off-center would add interest, perhaps use a leaf with a more interesting shape.  Using shadow to cut down on the glare of light helps, but leaves this looking flat.  Also, I try to make sure that the shadow covers the entire image so as not to get the distracting light like in the upper right corner.', '2007-10-10 15:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
