(4160096, 596853, 84656, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a greater DOF so that more of the leaf is in focus.  This would unfortunately bring some of the debris into focus, pity.  Lovely colours and well seen.</td>', 'I would have preferred a greater DOF so that more of the leaf is in focus.  This would unfortunately bring some of the debris into focus, pity.  Lovely colours and well seen.', '2007-10-11 12:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4160121, 596217, 84656, '<td valign="top">Gnome should have cleaned up the twig on the right ;)<br/> <br/>Would have preferred the gills in the front to be in focus as well to make the mushroom more dominant in the picture.  A tighter crop and slight change in angle to exclude the trees in the background may have been a better option.</td>', 'Gnome should have cleaned up the twig on the right ;) Would have preferred the gills in the front to be in focus as well to make the mushroom more dominant in the picture.  A tighter crop and slight change in angle to exclude the trees in the background may have been a better option.', '2007-10-11 12:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4160130, 597960, 84656, '<td valign="top">Not sure what has caused the hotspot in the centre.  Little triangle of blue at the top should have been eliminated.</td>', 'Not sure what has caused the hotspot in the centre.  Little triangle of blue at the top should have been eliminated.', '2007-10-11 12:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
