(4162756, 597437, 85155, '<td valign="top">The car really ruins this shot for me, and the flower is dead center, try thinking about using the rule of thirds here.  Move the flower to the top left and that might get rid of the car.  Yes I see that you titled it in suburbia, but it just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The car really ruins this shot for me, and the flower is dead center, try thinking about using the rule of thirds here.  Move the flower to the top left and that might get rid of the car.  Yes I see that you titled it in suburbia, but it just doesn''t work for me.', '2007-10-12 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
