(4162763, 595544, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think I like this shot mostly for its simplicity, your background has nothing to it, but it really adds to the mood of the shot.  It seems like the background is getting darker as you go up, but the sprout is getting lighter, I thought that was interesting.  This has potential for a ribbon.</td>', 'I think I like this shot mostly for its simplicity, your background has nothing to it, but it really adds to the mood of the shot.  It seems like the background is getting darker as you go up, but the sprout is getting lighter, I thought that was interesting.  This has potential for a ribbon.', '2007-10-12 12:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
