(4162803, 598245, 67697, '<td valign="top">This looks staged.  <br/>The lighting doesn''t look real.<br/>A different perspective might have helped this one.  Like say from the rock''s viewpoint.  Be the rock.<br/>Is this a snapshot?  Cuz it looks like one.<br/>The plant doesn''t look real, neither do the flowers.  <br/>It doesn''t even look like a plant.<br/>Why is it blessed?  Did it sneeze?<br/>DNMC because it''s green.</td>', 'This looks staged.  The lighting doesn''t look real.A different perspective might have helped this one.  Like say from the rock''s viewpoint.  Be the rock.Is this a snapshot?  Cuz it looks like one.The plant doesn''t look real, neither do the flowers.  It doesn''t even look like a plant.Why is it blessed?  Did it sneeze?DNMC because it''s green.', '2007-10-12 12:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4162805, 596072, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot looks really grainy.  I''m not sure what your iso was set at, but if it was high, lower it down and use a tripod.  Also the tree doesn''t really seem like the focal point here, my eyes are actually more drawn toward the two posts in the foreground.  It might help to make sure the tree is really tack sharp.</td>', 'This shot looks really grainy.  I''m not sure what your iso was set at, but if it was high, lower it down and use a tripod.  Also the tree doesn''t really seem like the focal point here, my eyes are actually more drawn toward the two posts in the foreground.  It might help to make sure the tree is really tack sharp.', '2007-10-12 12:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4162808, 598315, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice sun flare coming through here.  This is just your run of the mill shot everybody is doing, with a flower filling the frame, but the sun really makes this shot stand out.</td>', 'Nice sun flare coming through here.  This is just your run of the mill shot everybody is doing, with a flower filling the frame, but the sun really makes this shot stand out.', '2007-10-12 12:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
