(4163968, 596433, 44628, '<td valign="top">I wonder if using a faster shutter speed to freeze the butterfly would add to or take away from this image? I like it a lot, probably because it makes me curious!</td>', 'I wonder if using a faster shutter speed to freeze the butterfly would add to or take away from this image? I like it a lot, probably because it makes me curious!', '2007-10-12 23:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
