(4163977, 598322, 44628, '<td valign="top">I know that, as a photographer, we cannot control everything, but I really wish that the red blossom wasn''t in the background. Even though it has a nice bokeh, the brilliance of the color takes away from, what I feel otherwise, would be a fabulous image. Please understand that I do like the image. I feel that you have an excellent eye and it''s the most original idea I''ve seen thus far for a subject in this catagory, so there are some very strong points for this image.</td>', 'I know that, as a photographer, we cannot control everything, but I really wish that the red blossom wasn''t in the background. Even though it has a nice bokeh, the brilliance of the color takes away from, what I feel otherwise, would be a fabulous image. Please understand that I do like the image. I feel that you have an excellent eye and it''s the most original idea I''ve seen thus far for a subject in this catagory, so there are some very strong points for this image.', '2007-10-12 23:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
