(4165812, 597974, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is certainly one of the more inventive entries in the challenge.  I love the different colours, the crisp edges and the clear reflection.  I like the composition, but maybe a little wider DOF would improve the clarity on more of the leaf, or maybe pushing the focus point just slightly further back.  Hey, did somebody just get a new macro table?  :)</td>', 'This is certainly one of the more inventive entries in the challenge.  I love the different colours, the crisp edges and the clear reflection.  I like the composition, but maybe a little wider DOF would improve the clarity on more of the leaf, or maybe pushing the focus point just slightly further back.  Hey, did somebody just get a new macro table?  :)', '2007-10-14 00:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165818, 596553, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.  A little extra sharpness would go a long way.</td>', 'Nice colours.  A little extra sharpness would go a long way.', '2007-10-14 00:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165821, 598016, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Pancakes for sure.  This is a tricky scene for lighting.  There are obvious flash shadows, but if you diffuse it, you might end up with very boring flat lighting that doesn''t show the details.  Off camera lighting might be the better option, maybe even light painting with a torch.</td>', 'Wow.  Pancakes for sure.  This is a tricky scene for lighting.  There are obvious flash shadows, but if you diffuse it, you might end up with very boring flat lighting that doesn''t show the details.  Off camera lighting might be the better option, maybe even light painting with a torch.', '2007-10-14 00:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165823, 598278, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice little specimen.  Might be better non-centred in the frame.</td>', 'Nice little specimen.  Might be better non-centred in the frame.', '2007-10-14 00:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165825, 596736, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and lines, but lacks a specific subject to draw the eye in.</td>', 'Nice colours and lines, but lacks a specific subject to draw the eye in.', '2007-10-14 01:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165831, 596938, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very noticeable CA on the edges.  The main subject would improve with more contrast.  As it is, the eye is drawn away from the flower to the sharp thorns.  A different viewpoint might help to add more subject contrast, maybe giving side-light on the flower.</td>', 'Very noticeable CA on the edges.  The main subject would improve with more contrast.  As it is, the eye is drawn away from the flower to the sharp thorns.  A different viewpoint might help to add more subject contrast, maybe giving side-light on the flower.', '2007-10-14 01:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165833, 598337, 39430, '<td valign="top">Would be better if something was in focus.  :(  Also looks very blue, which can happen if a photo is taken in the shade using the full-sun white balance setting.</td>', 'Would be better if something was in focus.  :(  Also looks very blue, which can happen if a photo is taken in the shade using the full-sun white balance setting.', '2007-10-14 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
