(4172867, 596135, 65234, '<td valign="top">Placement of the flowers in the frame is nice with the diagonal stem leading my eye through the frame.  Lighting looks like maybe you used a flash?  Kind of unflattering to the flowers.</td>', 'Placement of the flowers in the frame is nice with the diagonal stem leading my eye through the frame.  Lighting looks like maybe you used a flash?  Kind of unflattering to the flowers.', '2007-10-16 22:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172868, 598260, 74588, '<td valign="top">what a statement   10</td>', 'what a statement   10', '2007-10-16 22:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172871, 596214, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; colors are a little pale.</td>', 'Nice composition; colors are a little pale.', '2007-10-16 22:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172875, 597693, 65234, '<td valign="top">Focus looks a little too soft.</td>', 'Focus looks a little too soft.', '2007-10-16 22:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172879, 595602, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very much like the background and DOF.  Not quite as fond of the dried leaves but not sure what would look any better.</td>', 'Very much like the background and DOF.  Not quite as fond of the dried leaves but not sure what would look any better.', '2007-10-16 22:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172883, 597780, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice pastels.</td>', 'Nice pastels.', '2007-10-16 22:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172968, 598255, 54446, '<td valign="top">stunning DOF effect.  (9)</td>', 'stunning DOF effect.  (9)', '2007-10-16 23:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172970, 596072, 65234, '<td valign="top">I am having trouble with the many elements in this shot not complementing one another.  I might prefer a closer, focussed shot of the tree, with ghostly images in the fog as background.</td>', 'I am having trouble with the many elements in this shot not complementing one another.  I might prefer a closer, focussed shot of the tree, with ghostly images in the fog as background.', '2007-10-16 23:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172973, 595194, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice color, composition and detail.</td>', 'Nice color, composition and detail.', '2007-10-16 23:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172976, 598334, 65234, '<td valign="top">Bokeh is complementary to the flower.  I might crop a bit more off the left side and the top to see more of the flower''s detail.</td>', 'Bokeh is complementary to the flower.  I might crop a bit more off the left side and the top to see more of the flower''s detail.', '2007-10-16 23:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172978, 597460, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pinwheel!  Neat flower.  I would crop a little more off the right and maybe use a shallower DOF (if possible) to blur the background more.</td>', 'Looks like a pinwheel!  Neat flower.  I would crop a little more off the right and maybe use a shallower DOF (if possible) to blur the background more.', '2007-10-16 23:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172987, 596165, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint and nice detail.  Partial desat works for me; can''t say if it''s an improvement over color but it''s OK as a technique to focus on texture and detail.</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint and nice detail.  Partial desat works for me; can''t say if it''s an improvement over color but it''s OK as a technique to focus on texture and detail.', '2007-10-16 23:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173137, 598422, 18367, '<td valign="top">While I can appreciate that you wanted to incorporate some of the more prominent buildings on the beach, the placement of the tree in the middle of the image does little to enhance the photo.  You might also want to align the horizon as it seems to tilt significantly to the right.</td>', 'While I can appreciate that you wanted to incorporate some of the more prominent buildings on the beach, the placement of the tree in the middle of the image does little to enhance the photo.  You might also want to align the horizon as it seems to tilt significantly to the right.', '2007-10-17 00:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173160, 598187, 18367, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the better images I have seen to date.  The DOF, clarity, balance and details captured in this photo should generate a very good score in this challenge.  The very best of luck to you.</td>', 'Definitely one of the better images I have seen to date.  The DOF, clarity, balance and details captured in this photo should generate a very good score in this challenge.  The very best of luck to you.', '2007-10-17 00:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173161, 597558, 70000, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this seems a bit too bright, maybe darkening the midtones and shadows would help</td>', 'The lighting on this seems a bit too bright, maybe darkening the midtones and shadows would help', '2007-10-17 00:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173162, 598426, 70000, '<td valign="top">Stunning flower, very unique shapes this is beautiful</td>', 'Stunning flower, very unique shapes this is beautiful', '2007-10-17 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173163, 597974, 19936, '<td valign="top">So simple, so elegant.</td>', 'So simple, so elegant.', '2007-10-17 00:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173165, 597569, 19936, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2007-10-17 00:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173167, 598058, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love the softness in the background but I think there could be more sharpness on the mushrooms</td>', 'I love the softness in the background but I think there could be more sharpness on the mushrooms', '2007-10-17 00:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173170, 598184, 70000, '<td valign="top">This might have been more appropriate in the fauna challenge seeing as the bug is the most in focus, lovely colors and soft focus though</td>', 'This might have been more appropriate in the fauna challenge seeing as the bug is the most in focus, lovely colors and soft focus though', '2007-10-17 00:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173173, 597337, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love your lighting and focus on the flower but I am not too fond of the background, it doesn''t seem to fit with the flower</td>', 'I love your lighting and focus on the flower but I am not too fond of the background, it doesn''t seem to fit with the flower', '2007-10-17 00:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173176, 597974, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is BEAUTIFUL! Unexpected and unique. I love the reflection and the colors. This definitely a fav!</td>', 'This is BEAUTIFUL! Unexpected and unique. I love the reflection and the colors. This definitely a fav!', '2007-10-17 00:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173180, 598411, 70000, '<td valign="top">I like the line in this but it is all so convoluted there doesn''t seem to be a central focal point</td>', 'I like the line in this but it is all so convoluted there doesn''t seem to be a central focal point', '2007-10-17 00:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173183, 598069, 70000, '<td valign="top">Really interesting patterns in the leaves and such, beautiful lighting to</td>', 'Really interesting patterns in the leaves and such, beautiful lighting to', '2007-10-17 00:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173196, 598413, 70000, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, the tem is a bit distracting here though I think a tighter crop isolating the flower and the face would be a stronger composition</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, the tem is a bit distracting here though I think a tighter crop isolating the flower and the face would be a stronger composition', '2007-10-17 00:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173201, 596576, 70000, '<td valign="top">wow, fabulous patterns and line. This is an awesome macro and works well in black and white</td>', 'wow, fabulous patterns and line. This is an awesome macro and works well in black and white', '2007-10-17 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173202, 596607, 70000, '<td valign="top">WOW! I love the different colors and tones in this one, the shallow depth of field is also very nice</td>', 'WOW! I love the different colors and tones in this one, the shallow depth of field is also very nice', '2007-10-17 00:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173205, 598022, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow lovely glow, it looks almost like there is a light in the flower. perfect colors!</td>', 'Wow lovely glow, it looks almost like there is a light in the flower. perfect colors!', '2007-10-17 00:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173209, 598121, 70000, '<td valign="top">What a lovely location, it is hard to tell the actual size of this place and if the plants are trees or bushes.</td>', 'What a lovely location, it is hard to tell the actual size of this place and if the plants are trees or bushes.', '2007-10-17 00:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
