(4173224, 596018, 70000, '<td valign="top">Lovely classic leaf shot, in focus with nice colors but I have seen many pictures just like this, maybe trying an angled center to have something different would be nice</td>', 'Lovely classic leaf shot, in focus with nice colors but I have seen many pictures just like this, maybe trying an angled center to have something different would be nice', '2007-10-17 00:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
