(4173744, 596011, 34462, '<td valign="top">If you are looking for comments on the lighting, I think it is right on... well maybe more brightness on the flower and less on the leaves. Also, a friend showed me how to remove the pollen from these flowers. It actually gives a different look to the flower. You may want to try it both ways.<br/>BTW: I thought this was a great shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-17 01:39:00.</i></td>', 'If you are looking for comments on the lighting, I think it is right on... well maybe more brightness on the flower and less on the leaves. Also, a friend showed me how to remove the pollen from these flowers. It actually gives a different look to the flower. You may want to try it both ways.BTW: I thought this was a great shot.', '2007-10-17 02:38:11.000000', '2007-10-17 02:39:00.000000', 0),
