(4174025, 595802, 73228, '<td valign="top">Hmm, First ever entry and I''m a bit confused. I was very careful not to spot edit the photo but looking at some of the entries (e.g. selective black and white) it seems like I could have spent some time bringing out detail in the leaves and adding contrast to the petals. Ah well, seeing the quality of photos above mine I also realise I have a lot to learn :-)</td>', 'Hmm, First ever entry and I''m a bit confused. I was very careful not to spot edit the photo but looking at some of the entries (e.g. selective black and white) it seems like I could have spent some time bringing out detail in the leaves and adding contrast to the petals. Ah well, seeing the quality of photos above mine I also realise I have a lot to learn :-)', '2007-10-17 05:21:17.000000', NULL, 0),
