(4174083, 597312, 66353, '<td valign="top">Congratulations a a great score Deb. :)<br/>This did a lot better than I had feared, but not quite as good as it deserved imo. And I''m very pleased to see the avg. score from your commenters :)<br/>Very well done</td>', 'Congratulations a a great score Deb. :)This did a lot better than I had feared, but not quite as good as it deserved imo. And I''m very pleased to see the avg. score from your commenters :)Very well done', '2007-10-17 05:41:53.000000', NULL, 0),
