(4174184, 597598, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow stunning colours and the riot of reds and yellow is really set off by the sky and mountain in the background which is a great natural backdrop<br/> <br/>Ohhhh and guess what....you beat me!!!!!</td>', 'Wow stunning colours and the riot of reds and yellow is really set off by the sky and mountain in the background which is a great natural backdrop Ohhhh and guess what....you beat me!!!!!', '2007-10-17 06:38:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174221, 595602, 68035, '<td valign="top">Karen<br/> <br/>I hope you dont get bored of me saying this but this is another truly magnificent photo.  I have to be honest and say generally I found the flora challenge a bit wearying to mark.  There were so many great macro shots of flowers but these almost became overpowering and left the viewer feeling a bit blase and non plussed.  This however was a fantastic exception.  The focus and dof you have used created an image which was both interesting in terms of the main subject and in which the natural background of stars created a real visual treat<br/> <br/>I love it</td>', 'Karen I hope you dont get bored of me saying this but this is another truly magnificent photo.  I have to be honest and say generally I found the flora challenge a bit wearying to mark.  There were so many great macro shots of flowers but these almost became overpowering and left the viewer feeling a bit blase and non plussed.  This however was a fantastic exception.  The focus and dof you have used created an image which was both interesting in terms of the main subject and in which the natural background of stars created a real visual treat I love it', '2007-10-17 06:50:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174241, 595904, 68035, '<td valign="top">Hey you, good job and it feels like you have got your love of challenges back which is great.  Love the soft range of blue hues from the sky to the sea and the way that this emphasises colour of the  leaves on the branch.  Great application of the rule of thirds as well<br/> <br/>Nice shot Michelle</td>', 'Hey you, good job and it feels like you have got your love of challenges back which is great.  Love the soft range of blue hues from the sky to the sea and the way that this emphasises colour of the  leaves on the branch.  Great application of the rule of thirds as well Nice shot Michelle', '2007-10-17 06:55:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174248, 596561, 67152, '<td valign="top">Jon - I really thought this was much better than a 5.0.  The sharpness was very good and the composition is solid.  The background does not really add too much to the image and the lighting may have been a bit harsh on the flowers - a lot of detail is missing.  All in all, though, I thought it deserved a better score and I gave it a 6.</td>', 'Jon - I really thought this was much better than a 5.0.  The sharpness was very good and the composition is solid.  The background does not really add too much to the image and the lighting may have been a bit harsh on the flowers - a lot of detail is missing.  All in all, though, I thought it deserved a better score and I gave it a 6.', '2007-10-17 06:56:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174259, 597409, 68035, '<td valign="top">Peter<br/> <br/>When I saw this in the challenge I loved it but wondered whether it would get marked down as not being ''flora'' enough.  So glad that it didnt, this was a really refreshing change and I love the backdrop of a wall of leaves.  Great contrast on the branches as well which gives the picture a 3d feel and lots of ''pop''</td>', 'Peter When I saw this in the challenge I loved it but wondered whether it would get marked down as not being ''flora'' enough.  So glad that it didnt, this was a really refreshing change and I love the backdrop of a wall of leaves.  Great contrast on the branches as well which gives the picture a 3d feel and lots of ''pop''', '2007-10-17 06:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174265, 597974, 25355, '<td valign="top">Welcome back (when you get back), and here''s your surprise - a yellow ribbon. Congratulations.</td>', 'Welcome back (when you get back), and here''s your surprise - a yellow ribbon. Congratulations.', '2007-10-17 07:03:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174268, 598255, 68035, '<td valign="top">The flowers are indeed beautiful and the lilac/yellow/green colour combination works fantastically<br/> <br/>Super dof as well which gives the backdrop a hint of bokeh without diminshing its impact</td>', 'The flowers are indeed beautiful and the lilac/yellow/green colour combination works fantastically Super dof as well which gives the backdrop a hint of bokeh without diminshing its impact', '2007-10-17 07:04:55.000000', NULL, 0),
