(4174662, 595803, 69069, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Veiolets:</b></div><hr/><i> sorry, isn''t pleasing to me, just appears to be a mistake. 4 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not a mistake at all!! Quite intentional. I played with focus at all different parts of the flower and even played with having the entire flower in focus.  But this is what pleased me the most!  Oh well.  Guess not everyone likes it in the abstract!</td>', 'Originally posted by Veiolets: sorry, isn''t pleasing to me, just appears to be a mistake. 4   Not a mistake at all!! Quite intentional. I played with focus at all different parts of the flower and even played with having the entire flower in focus.  But this is what pleased me the most!  Oh well.  Guess not everyone likes it in the abstract!', '2007-10-17 10:14:48.000000', NULL, 0),
