(4174987, 596072, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol oh my - so this is your lowest scoring pic.  Well I was one of your 6''s.  I liked the abstract quality of it and also the different layers of nature that you had going on in the pic.  The white posts did not bother me, I could see where that was used as some kind of entrance point in the pic.  I did find the white spot to be a distraction tho and that is why i did not score this higher.  Pardon me for laughing - ths score is silly.</td>', 'lol oh my - so this is your lowest scoring pic.  Well I was one of your 6''s.  I liked the abstract quality of it and also the different layers of nature that you had going on in the pic.  The white posts did not bother me, I could see where that was used as some kind of entrance point in the pic.  I did find the white spot to be a distraction tho and that is why i did not score this higher.  Pardon me for laughing - ths score is silly.', '2007-10-17 11:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174997, 595602, 67697, '<td valign="top">Karen i loved this pic and I wish it had finished higher.  There''s such a magical quality to it, with the green sparkles in the background.  It''s beautiful!</td>', 'Karen i loved this pic and I wish it had finished higher.  There''s such a magical quality to it, with the green sparkles in the background.  It''s beautiful!', '2007-10-17 11:45:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4175010, 598187, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congrats Catherine! This is beautiful!</td>', 'Congrats Catherine! This is beautiful!', '2007-10-17 11:48:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4175019, 596561, 44877, '<td valign="top">Hot damn! I did beat you, didn''t I? Believe me, I did not submit that floral image thinking I''d get a 5.1, but so it goes. And only one comment, no less. So I''m not clear on what the voters didn''t like. <br/> <br/>Love yours - it''s very compelling with the dark green and the white flower against it. <br/> <br/>I have nothing in challenges right now. Was so disgusted with my last two scores that I decided just to do sides for a while. I think it''s called pouting. :o)</td>', 'Hot damn! I did beat you, didn''t I? Believe me, I did not submit that floral image thinking I''d get a 5.1, but so it goes. And only one comment, no less. So I''m not clear on what the voters didn''t like.  Love yours - it''s very compelling with the dark green and the white flower against it.  I have nothing in challenges right now. Was so disgusted with my last two scores that I decided just to do sides for a while. I think it''s called pouting. :o)', '2007-10-17 11:49:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4175026, 595904, 62318, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the out of focus comment. Looks in focus to me, maybe I need glasses. Nice color study and I find the composition very pleasing. It doesn''t look over saturated to me.</td>', 'I don''t get the out of focus comment. Looks in focus to me, maybe I need glasses. Nice color study and I find the composition very pleasing. It doesn''t look over saturated to me.', '2007-10-17 11:50:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4175067, 596221, 37961, '<td valign="top"><b>Morning Has Broken</b> <br/><i>As Sung by Cat Stevens</i> <br/> <br/>Morning has broken, like the first morning<br/>Blackbird has spoken, like the first bird<br/>Praise for the singing, praise for the morning<br/>Praise for the springing fresh from the word<br/> <br/>Sweet the rain''s new fall, sunlit from heaven<br/>Like the first dewfall, on the first grass<br/>Praise for the sweetness of the wet garden<br/>Sprung in completeness where his feet pass<br/> <br/>Mine is the sunlight, mine is the morning<br/>Born of the one light, Eden saw play<br/>Praise with elation, praise every morning<br/>God''s recreation of the new day<br/>---------------------------------------<br/> <br/>That song came to my head when I saw your photo and title.<br/></td>', 'Morning Has Broken As Sung by Cat Stevens  Morning has broken, like the first morningBlackbird has spoken, like the first birdPraise for the singing, praise for the morningPraise for the springing fresh from the word Sweet the rain''s new fall, sunlit from heavenLike the first dewfall, on the first grassPraise for the sweetness of the wet gardenSprung in completeness where his feet pass Mine is the sunlight, mine is the morningBorn of the one light, Eden saw playPraise with elation, praise every morningGod''s recreation of the new day--------------------------------------- That song came to my head when I saw your photo and title.', '2007-10-17 11:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4175163, 595602, 3724, '<td valign="top">really great pov, excellent edit.</td>', 'really great pov, excellent edit.', '2007-10-17 12:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4175172, 597984, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooooh. . .I like this.   I''m disappointed that more people didn''t see what I see: rich colors, a striking composition, interesting all the way around!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ooooooh. . .I like this.   I''m disappointed that more people didn''t see what I see: rich colors, a striking composition, interesting all the way around! ', '2007-10-17 12:20:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4175223, 598187, 66384, '<td valign="top">WOW Catherine, this is awesome!!! I was totally admiring the blue ribbon winning photo, and thinking how much it deserved a blue ribbon before I realized it was your entry. I am so happy you have advanced to this level. It is wonderful. The DOF, the detail, the color, and the composition are all fabulous. CONGRATULATIONS!</td>', 'WOW Catherine, this is awesome!!! I was totally admiring the blue ribbon winning photo, and thinking how much it deserved a blue ribbon before I realized it was your entry. I am so happy you have advanced to this level. It is wonderful. The DOF, the detail, the color, and the composition are all fabulous. CONGRATULATIONS!', '2007-10-17 12:32:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4175227, 597332, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Puckzzzzzzzz!!!!   WOW!!!!!!   This is flora at its finest!  Congratulations on this well deserved award-winning photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Puckzzzzzzzz!!!!   WOW!!!!!!   This is flora at its finest!  Congratulations on this well deserved award-winning photo! ', '2007-10-17 12:34:31.000000', NULL, 0),
