(4177768, 597257, 30982, '<td valign="top">That is a fascinating flower.  Can''t say I''ve ever seen anything like it!  Very well photographed to show off its intricate detail, like the green fringes on the petals.  Great score, and congrats on not only a new PB, but a second 6 in a row.  That''s not easy to do in these parts!</td>', 'That is a fascinating flower.  Can''t say I''ve ever seen anything like it!  Very well photographed to show off its intricate detail, like the green fringes on the petals.  Great score, and congrats on not only a new PB, but a second 6 in a row.  That''s not easy to do in these parts!', '2007-10-18 08:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
