(4198951, 597312, 28742, '<td valign="top">Weed on acid?? Ah well, don''t ask don''t tell. :) Great job, Deb, I could go through all the comments and just repeat, but... no, wait, I think I will do that. Hang on- be right back...<br/> <br/>...ok-- Congratulations, very nice composition and processing which makes for a stunning and unique shot with superb lighting, excellent shadows and lovely color tone. Beautiful in its simplicity, it demonstrates admirable skill and a clever mind and good eye to produce such a gorgeous, fantastic image with rich textures great tones and an inspired tint! Artfully perfect. I love it. Cool.<br/> <br/>I figured a composite would be quicker than quoting all those comments and saying "I agree", "Yep", "What she said", etc.<br/> <br/>Really do love the image, Deb and hope you''re staying safe.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-27 02:03:01.</i></td>', 'Weed on acid?? Ah well, don''t ask don''t tell. :) Great job, Deb, I could go through all the comments and just repeat, but... no, wait, I think I will do that. Hang on- be right back... ...ok-- Congratulations, very nice composition and processing which makes for a stunning and unique shot with superb lighting, excellent shadows and lovely color tone. Beautiful in its simplicity, it demonstrates admirable skill and a clever mind and good eye to produce such a gorgeous, fantastic image with rich textures great tones and an inspired tint! Artfully perfect. I love it. Cool. I figured a composite would be quicker than quoting all those comments and saying "I agree", "Yep", "What she said", etc. Really do love the image, Deb and hope you''re staying safe.', '2007-10-27 02:52:12.000000', '2007-10-27 03:03:01.000000', 0),
