(4496025, 598245, 68947, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> This looks staged.  <br/>The lighting doesn''t look real.<br/>A different perspective might have helped this one.  Like say from the rock''s viewpoint.  Be the rock.<br/>Is this a snapshot?  Cuz it looks like one.<br/>The plant doesn''t look real, neither do the flowers.  <br/>It doesn''t even look like a plant.<br/>Why is it blessed?  Did it sneeze?<br/>DNMC because it''s green. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Poor thing came from the gutter and was revived by a passerby.  He took it home and nursed it back to health.  Upon hearing that someone wanted it, he willingly gave it away and as he did, he uttered the words......"Bless you, my special plant.....go forth and cast your branches, sprouting blessings on everyone!"  <br/> <br/>And, so it was...this blessed plant has spread its luck on those who gaze upon it, bathed in Blessed Light.......<br/> <br/>JUST NOT IN DPC''s Challenges!!!! *grin*</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: This looks staged.  The lighting doesn''t look real.A different perspective might have helped this one.  Like say from the rock''s viewpoint.  Be the rock.Is this a snapshot?  Cuz it looks like one.The plant doesn''t look real, neither do the flowers.  It doesn''t even look like a plant.Why is it blessed?  Did it sneeze?DNMC because it''s green.   Poor thing came from the gutter and was revived by a passerby.  He took it home and nursed it back to health.  Upon hearing that someone wanted it, he willingly gave it away and as he did, he uttered the words......"Bless you, my special plant.....go forth and cast your branches, sprouting blessings on everyone!"   And, so it was...this blessed plant has spread its luck on those who gaze upon it, bathed in Blessed Light....... JUST NOT IN DPC''s Challenges!!!! *grin*', '2008-02-18 21:30:18.000000', NULL, 0),
