(4559557, 597974, 31244, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ChikaZAWa:</b></div><hr/><i> Kinda boring... No offense </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow, you really don''t know what you are talking about.  Why in the world would this be boring? The subject matter is completely enthralling.  <br/> <br/>Plus, she''s got way more ribbons than you, so its obvious that you can in no way critique her photography.</td>', 'Originally posted by ChikaZAWa: Kinda boring... No offense   Wow, you really don''t know what you are talking about.  Why in the world would this be boring? The subject matter is completely enthralling.   Plus, she''s got way more ribbons than you, so its obvious that you can in no way critique her photography.', '2008-03-12 21:09:37.000000', NULL, 0),
