(4932243, 596063, 96391, '<td valign="top">Why this photo has got maximum marks compared to other works of the photographer? The reason according to ''me''; there exists a natural gradient in the color and hue. Mind the word ''natural''. This should be a good example for capturing future snaps, look for naturally occurring situations or while arranging objects make sure that there is a smooth transition in colors.<br/>Check a white spot in your ''fruit salad'' photo, near middle left. You should do a lot of filtering mentally before aiming for a shot, then again go for a last check keeping the perspective in the lens.<br/>Good luck!<br/>I liked the ''romantic'' title of the photo ''Welcome home''.</td>', 'Why this photo has got maximum marks compared to other works of the photographer? The reason according to ''me''; there exists a natural gradient in the color and hue. Mind the word ''natural''. This should be a good example for capturing future snaps, look for naturally occurring situations or while arranging objects make sure that there is a smooth transition in colors.Check a white spot in your ''fruit salad'' photo, near middle left. You should do a lot of filtering mentally before aiming for a shot, then again go for a last check keeping the perspective in the lens.Good luck!I liked the ''romantic'' title of the photo ''Welcome home''.', '2008-09-03 19:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4950658, 597332, 67237, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know of this case until now. I agree with you 100%. It is ridiculous to DQ an image for the use of a soft filter in the camera. The Basic Editing rules are nothing but EDITING rules, and you have NOT edited anything here. You were robbed!!.  Congratulations for this fantastic image.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I didn''t know of this case until now. I agree with you 100%. It is ridiculous to DQ an image for the use of a soft filter in the camera. The Basic Editing rules are nothing but EDITING rules, and you have NOT edited anything here. You were robbed!!.  Congratulations for this fantastic image. ', '2008-09-11 16:37:03.000000', NULL, 0),
